r Custom PC\",\"hook\":\"Navigating the vast array of CPUs, GPUs, motherboards, and RAM can be daunting. This guide breaks down how to balance performance, budget, and compatibility to select the perfect components for your specific needs.\",\"contentType\":\"guide\",\"category\":\"PC Hardware\",\"targetAudience\":\"Intermediate PC Builders, Budget-Conscious Buyers\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"commercial\",\"keywords\":[\"PC component selection\",\"best parts for custom PC\",\"CPU vs GPU guide\",\"motherboard compatibility\",\"RAM selection tips\"]},{\"id\":\"troubleshooting-new-pc-build\",\"title\":\"Troubleshooting Your New PC Build: Diagnosing and Fixing Common Post-Assembly Issues\",\"hook\":\"Nothing is more frustrating than a new PC that won't boot or has unexpected errors. Learn to identify and resolve the most frequent post-build problems, from no display output to boot loops, saving you hours of headache.\",\"contentType\":\"explainer\",\"category\":\"PC Hardware\",\"targetAudience\":\"All PC Builders (Beginner to Intermediate)\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"PC build troubleshooting\",\"computer won't boot\",\"no display after build\",\"common PC build errors\",\"diagnostic steps for new PC\"]},{\"id\":\"high-performance-workstation-build\",\"title\":\"Building a High-Performance Workstation PC: A Deep Dive into Professional-Grade Hardware\",\"hook\":\"Move beyond gaming rigs and explore the specialized world of workstation PCs designed for intense productivity, 3D rendering, and data analysis. Discover the critical hardware considerations for uncompromising professional performance.\",\"contentType\":\"guide\",\"category\":\"PC Hardware, Professional Computing\",\"targetAudience\":\"Advanced PC Builders, Professionals, Content Creators\",\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"workstation PC build\",\"high performance computer\",\"profession