se working with game engines, 3D modeling, animation, and real-time rendering.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"For General Purpose and Web Developers\",\"description\":\"Provide guidance for developers whose primary tasks are less GPU-intensive but still benefit from a capable card for occasional heavier workloads.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Conclusion: Future-Proofing Your Development Rig\",\"description\":\"Summarize the key findings and reiterate the most important factors for developers to consider when selecting a mid-range GPU in 2026, emphasizing the balance between current needs and future demands.\",\"level\":2}]}","responseLength":6420,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":419,"outputTokens":1918,"totalTokens":3787},"estimatedCost":0.001214,"promptName":"planner","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":0}
