n and advanced technology. Vivid colors, modern aesthetic, no text.\",\"altText\":\"A futuristic digital art banner depicting three evolving GPU models (RTX 3060, 4060, 5060) surrounded by glowing data streams and neural network patterns, symbolizing their use in AI and game development for 2026. High-tech, vivid colors, 16:9 aspect ratio.\"}","responseLength":1080,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":272,"outputTokens":253,"totalTokens":1214},"estimatedCost":0.000193,"promptName":"publisher-image","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":0}
