p khi tự dựng PC cho người mới bắt đầu (Phần 2 - chọn theo nhu cầu) (Build PC)"}]},"executionTimeMs":12319,"success":true,"response":"{\"ideas\":[{\"id\":\"i9-cpu-worth-it-guide\",\"title\":\"Is an Intel Core i9 CPU Worth It? A Comprehensive Guide for High-Performance Users\",\"hook\":\"Thinking of upgrading to an Intel Core i9? Discover if this top-tier processor truly meets your demanding needs for gaming, content creation, and professional tasks.\",\"contentType\":\"guide\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"PC builders, gamers, content creators, professionals, power users\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"i9 CPU worth it\",\"intel core i9 guide\",\"i9 for gaming\",\"i9 for video editing\",\"high performance CPU\",\"i9 vs i7\"]},{\"id\":\"i9-cpu-generations-comparison\",\"title\":\"Intel Core i9 Generations Compared: Which i9 CPU is Best for Your Build?\",\"hook\":\"Navigating the different generations of Intel Core i9 CPUs can be tricky. We break down the performance, features, and ideal use cases for each to help you make the best choice.\",\"contentType\":\"comparison\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"PC enthusiasts, upgraders, advanced users, tech buyers\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"commercial\",\"keywords\":[\"i9 generations comparison\",\"best i9 CPU\",\"i9-13900K vs i9-12900K\",\"latest i9 CPU review\",\"intel i9 performance\"]},{\"id\":\"optimize-i9-cpu-guide\",\"title\":\"Unleashing the Power: How to Optimize Your i9 CPU for 4K Video Editing and Streaming\",\"hook\":\"Got an Intel Core i9 but not getting the performance you expect for heavy tasks? Learn expert tips and settings to fully optimize your i9 for seamless 4K editing, live streaming, and more.\",\"contentType\":\"tutorial\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"Content creators, streamers, professionals, power users\",\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"optimize i9 CPU\",\"i9 settings for video editing\",\"i9 for streaming\",\"intel i9 performance tips\",\"overclock i9 guide\"]},{\"id\":\"i9-motherboard-cooling-guide\",\"title\":\"Top Motherboards and Cooling Solutions for Intel Core i9 CPUs: Maximizing Performance\",\"hook\":\"An Intel Core i9 demands the best supporting components. Discover the top-rated motherboards and essential cooling solutions to unlock your i9's full potential without thermal throttling.\",\"contentType\":\"listicle\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"PC builders, enthusiasts, those upgrading to i9, advanced users\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"commercial\",\"keywords\":[\"best motherboard for i9\",\"i9 cooling solution\",\"AIO for i9\",\"liquid cooler i9\",\"Z790 i9\",\"intel i9 compatible motherboards\"]},{\"id\":\"i9-cpu-mistakes-avoid\",\"title\":\"5 Common Mistakes to Avoid When Building with an Intel Core i9 CPU\",\"hook\":\"Investing in an Intel Core i9 is a big decision. Make sure you avoid these common pitfalls related to compatibility, cooling, power supply, and budget to ensure a smooth, high-performance build.\",\"contentType\":\"explainer\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"First-time i9 buyers, intermediate PC builders, tech enthusiasts\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"i9 CPU mistakes\",\"i9 compatibility\",\"i9 power supply requirements\",\"i9 cooling requirements\",\"buying i9 tips\",\"intel i9 considerations\"]}]}","responseLength":3178,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":487,"outputTokens":1033,"totalTokens":3013},"estimatedCost":0.000693,"userId":"67eecc12ea4a3b227ed8a3db","featureId":"content_studio_ideas","telemetryKey":"ai.content_studio.ideas","promptName":"custom","retryCount":0}
