mposition is clean and futuristic, with a strong emphasis on vivid colors against a dark, sophisticated backdrop. No text or words.\",\"altText\":\"A high-tech digital art banner featuring a glowing, stylized Intel Core i3 processor chip at its core, surrounded by vibrant blue and green data streams and interconnected pathways. The image symbolizes the longevity, future-proofing, and upgrade potential of Intel Core i3 processors, with abstract circuit board patterns representing technological evolution relevant for developers and coding.\"}","responseLength":1089,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":271,"outputTokens":206,"totalTokens":1346},"estimatedCost":0.000164,"promptName":"publisher-image","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":0}
