r coding and maximize its lifespan.\",\"slug\":\"intel-core-i3-longevity-future-proofing-upgrade-paths-for-devs\",\"tags\":[\"Intel Core i3\",\"CPU longevity\",\"future-proofing\",\"upgrade paths\",\"developer hardware\",\"coding performance\",\"i3 lifespan\",\"tech upgrades\"],\"category\":\"Hardware\"}","responseLength":415,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":391,"outputTokens":137,"totalTokens":1019},"estimatedCost":0.000141,"promptName":"publisher-seo","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":0}
