nformational\",\"keywords\":[\"SSD vs HDD\",\"NVMe vs SATA\",\"best PC storage\",\"M.2 SSD explained\",\"gaming PC storage\",\"how much storage do I need\"]},{\"id\":\"build_pc_cooling_guide\",\"title\":\"Stay Cool: A Comprehensive Guide to PC Cooling Solutions (Air, AIO, and Custom Loops)\",\"hook\":\"Overheating is a PC killer. Discover the best cooling methods to keep your components frosty and extend their lifespan, from air coolers to advanced liquid systems.\",\"contentType\":\"comparison\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"Intermediate builders, overclockers, performance enthusiasts\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"PC cooling guide\",\"air cooler vs AIO\",\"best CPU cooler\",\"liquid cooling PC setup\",\"case fan placement\",\"PC thermal management\"]},{\"id\":\"build_pc_budget_productivity\",\"title\":\"Build a Powerful Productivity PC Under $800: Your Ultimate Budget-Friendly Guide\",\"hook\":\"Get serious work done without breaking the bank. This guide shows you how to assemble a high-performance PC perfect for office tasks, content creation, and everyday computing on a tight budget.\",\"contentType\":\"listicle\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"Budget-conscious users, students, home office workers, small business owners\",\"difficulty\":\"beginner\",\"searchIntent\":\"transactional\",\"keywords\":[\"budget PC build under $800\",\"best PC for home office\",\"affordable workstation PC\",\"cheap productivity PC\",\"value PC components\"]},{\"id\":\"build_pc_troubleshooting_guide\",\"title\":\"My New PC Won't Boot! Common Troubleshooting Steps for First-Time Builders\",\"hook\":\"Built your PC but it won't turn on or display anything? Don't panic! This guide walks you through the most common issues and how to fix them.\",\"contentType\":\"tutorial\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"First-time PC builders, anyone experiencing post-build issues\",\"difficulty\":\"beginner\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"PC won't POST\",\"no display after PC build\",\"PC not booting\",\"troubleshoot new PC build\",\"common PC build errors\",\"RAM not detected\",\"CPU fan error\"]}]}","responseLength":3096,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":731,"outputTokens":991,"totalTokens":4229},"estimatedCost":0.000704,"userId":"67eecc12ea4a3b227ed8a3db","featureId":"content_studio_ideas","telemetryKey":"ai.content_studio.ideas","promptName":"custom","retryCount":0}
