sential connectors for your\",\"slug\":\"ultimate-guide-choosing-pc-power-supply-unit-psu\",\"tags\":[\"PC Power Supply\",\"PSU\",\"PC Building\",\"Wattage Calculator\",\"80 Plus\",\"Modular PSU\",\"Power Connectors\",\"Computer Hardware\"],\"category\":\"Hardware\"}","responseLength":388,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":382,"outputTokens":136,"totalTokens":966},"estimatedCost":0.000139,"promptName":"publisher-seo","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":0}
