t market trends.\",\"contentType\":\"news\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"PC builders, budget-conscious buyers, tech enthusiasts\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"GPU price trends\",\"graphics card market\",\"affordable GPUs\",\"PC building costs\",\"GPU news\",\"mid-range GPUs\",\"component pricing\"]},{\"id\":\"pc_news_003\",\"title\":\"PCIe Gen 5 SSDs Go Mainstream: How Ultra-Fast Storage is Changing PC Builds\",\"hook\":\"The next generation of storage is here. PCIe Gen 5 SSDs are no longer just for enthusiasts, bringing unprecedented speeds that promise to redefine PC performance. Here's what you need to know.\",\"contentType\":\"news\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"PC builders, performance enthusiasts, storage upgraders\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"PCIe Gen 5 SSDs\",\"NVMe storage news\",\"fastest SSDs\",\"PC building innovation\",\"storage technology\",\"M.2 Gen 5\",\"data transfer speeds\"]},{\"id\":\"pc_news_004\",\"title\":\"ATX 3.0 PSUs & 12VHPWR: The New Standard for High-Performance PC Builds\",\"hook\":\"As graphics cards demand more power, the ATX 3.0 standard and 12VHPWR connectors are becoming essential. We explore why your next PSU choice is more critical than ever.\",\"contentType\":\"news\",\"category\":\"Build PC\",\"targetAudience\":\"PC builders, high-end GPU owners, system integrators\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"keywords\":[\"ATX 3.0 PSU\",\"12VHPWR connector\",\"power supply news\",\"PC power standard\",\"next-gen PSUs\",\"GPU power requirements\",\"power delivery\"]},{\"id\":\"pc_news_005\",\"title\":\"Eco-Friendly PC Building: The Rise of Sustainable Components and Practices\",\"hook\":\"Beyond raw power, the PC building community is increasingly looking towards sustainability. Discover how manufacturers and builders are embracing greener components and pract